Spec: Legacy gateway packaging entry

Purpose:
  Reproduce the existing Windows and Android package without mixing new development Agent artifacts into the installed version.

Owns:
  ./build.ps1

Must:
  Preserve locked diagnostic runtimes and persistent signing identities, generating local artifacts without deploying or installing them.
  Select Gradle9.3.1 explicitly or from the supplied toolchain and run only legacy app tasks; development fixture modules must not enter legacy packaging.
